 "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d853c7656a4a784027246c26ba7210d780aa316a", "message": "Refractor File Structure", "created_at": "2021-09-14T06:12:14Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "95edb82c799037d1d610d4bf7a2900535e54de9c", "message": "Use Checkboxes to Delete Multiple Exams", "created_at": "2021-09-14T06:03:41Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "459ceee78fdcef9162b355f049a03addefa14afe", "message": "Revert \"Revert \"Add Image to Student from Gallery\"\"\n\nThis reverts commit 6f096d48331e6f2bf94c4f658091a7b6878bd254.", "created_at": "2021-09-14T03:27:07Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6f096d48331e6f2bf94c4f658091a7b6878bd254", "message": "Revert \"Add Image to Student from Gallery\"\n\nThis reverts commit 32c98917d79d6bab5ed3a827cfee0f0981b0a7e3.", "created_at": "2021-09-14T03:17:09Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "32c98917d79d6bab5ed3a827cfee0f0981b0a7e3", "message": "Add Image to Student from Gallery", "created_at": "2021-09-14T02:43:49Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0a033211ea70d2d4d8db9310652d90dfa1ae9a3a", "message": "WHERE clause for Home HomeFragment\n\nAdded a basic SQLite WHERE clause for checking if the exam is in the future, if so then we display it on the home screen as an upcoming exam.", "created_at": "2021-09-13T23:45:57Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bf9f873e461328d22b9064f0c08ce730c6ae4460", "message": "Add Home Screen Functionality\n\nIncludes updates to the home screen fragment to allow for exams to be seen there. So far it displays all exams there, though this will be changed to only include exams within a period (ie. in this next week).", "created_at": "2021-09-13T22:53:51Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d65f2b656b18b51ea0002f778f338c3d2d6f1450", "message": "Minor Bug Fixes", "created_at": "2021-09-13T01:30:34Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e78d6cf5344cd9244468bbc7b4a49a9d9dcfced", "message": "Student Address in Google Maps\n\nStudent Address can now be viewed in a google maps fragment in a separate Maps Activity.", "created_at": "2021-09-10T09:52:35Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ae2c5c517a035a641fe9043cd5234b8f6dbf4c13", "message": "Added Student Images\n\nStudent Records now have images. They are stored in the SQLite database as a byte-array and then converted to Bitmap for displaying.\nThere is a bug where a new editor fragment pops up when the image is changed (either using the external gallery or camera).", "created_at": "2021-09-10T09:19:48Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ea862d8499ed928b3882e5a7ff45f4dbf3c85cec", "message": "Gallery Functionality\n\nDecided to implement the gallery a little differently to how we were asked. It is essentially a gallery of all images on the device. Images cannot be selected to view larger than the 4 column grid.\nImages can be selected by long-clicking and deselected by short-clicking. Both of these actions also show the file path as a snackbar.\nThe code is not yet commented properly, though that is high-priority and will hopefully be done tomorrow.", "created_at": "2021-09-09T09:22:48Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "43eb675b420c602cd6f02622a2669cffd6d05615", "message": "Started Gallery\n\nCurrently there is a gallery implementation that shows the photos on the users device. They can press or hold a photo and a snackbar will say which action they did to which photo, but no other gallery functionality is implemented currently.\nPlan on adding long-click to select image/s and click to deselect images that are already selected.\nMay also add an \"add\" button to the toolbar to allow the user to take a new photo in their default camera app (hence adding a photo to the apps gallery).", "created_at": "2021-09-07T01:35:19Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7811b2acc3b7cd272c578b6ce885b29895832fba", "message": "Completed Notifications\n\nNotification-based reminders for exams are now functional. There is a rather large bug with the notifications; the first notification works as intended on its own, but if you try to schedule another then the original notification will instead be sent at the new time. If the first notification has already been received when the next is sent then it schedules a notification at the new time but the content is the same, original notification.", "created_at": "2021-09-05T09:37:10Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cef3f3c9d39ef2236b78cc9b8399bdd20eebd47e", "message": "Rudimentary Timed Exam Notifications\n\nExam notifications are now functional but need to be optimised and the code needs to be cleaned.", "created_at": "2021-09-04T06:06:54Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6eec6f278018c2f59c34300266a757228bdfad91", "message": "Exam View - Time Between\n\nNow displays the time between in the exam view as well.", "created_at": "2021-09-04T00:45:04Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e8b0e09fa2c73bf3f4d47f4616a407a6d53235e8", "message": "New App Logo\n\nAdded a new custom logo to the app and splash screen.", "created_at": "2021-09-03T23:10:34Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "74ca6ff67b6e0ab88d68c2487c1836c050b6759d", "message": "Exam Notification Beta\n\nStarted working on notifications to remind user on the day of an exam they have set. Currently all notifications are set to immediately (this is a bug not intentional).", "created_at": "2021-09-03T22:47:02Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c978aa8e72432d5dbb054241025ca2adb338aa93", "message": "Exam Color Coding\n\nExam 'cards' are now color coded so that:\n- Future exams are green\n- Running exams are blue\n- Past exams are yellow/orange", "created_at": "2021-09-03T08:54:13Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4fd05b5df062edc78c72d47f15746fac6520ba25", "message": "Time Till Exam\n\nFunctionality for making a string to say the time till, and since the exam started or finished. Needs to be optimized but is pretty good at the moment considering its the first version.", "created_at": "2021-09-03T07:04:35Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "42ee3a632c09fd21c2b6466c9269755551c698b2", "message": "Exams\n\nMost of the required (white labelled) functionality for exams. One more small implementation of flagging overdue exams and then the Distinction level content is done.\nNo extra items (yellow labelled) for exams have been completed yet.", "created_at": "2021-09-03T02:32:02Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e6d7011e8a05291fe338be0e6132e54b75bb2e74", "message": "Started Exams\n\nBegan working on Exam functionality for within each students record. Decided to go for a parent-child table approach for the exams DB as this seems to work better within SQLite (found through research not practice).\nIm going to implement the activity of exams (for each student) very much like the activities for tasks and records, with the same components, using a recycler view to display the data. I may allow users to then press on an exam to view more about it later on (and may also add this functionality to records to make it less crammed).", "created_at": "2021-08-31T10:41:29Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dafdc655021447ba28b9a284a81a867f48ecda7d", "message": "Began Image Saving\n\nThe functionality for image saving is incomplete. I am able to get the path when we select an image from the gallery, but not when we take a picture with the camera. I am hoping to save the path of the file in the database (rather than an image or image blob).", "created_at": "2021-08-31T06:51:34Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "65dce2371d0c186d58f6987f5dc83366f2bf6ce5", "message": "Student Records\n\nCompleted the Student records except for the image functionality (which is in beta currently).\nFixed the bug where the todo-list has a white status bar.\nIntroduced the use of SnackBars to undo accidental deletes and removed warning alert dialogs.", "created_at": "2021-08-31T05:47:01Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "62b27ae5086e3c8cd565e2e168e4093748360e7f", "message": "Commented & Completed To-Do List\n\nThere is still a bug in the todo list activity such that a white block is placed over the status bar. Other than this bug, the todo list activity is complete.", "created_at": "2021-08-31T00:17:35Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "39b6d2eeb762be61326459d427486baffd661b97", "message": "Changed Tasks to Use Toolbar. Fixed minor bugs.", "created_at": "2021-08-19T01:00:23Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d08842af8c41a5f1079f8273bdc1a18b3a3e974d", "message": "Navbar", "created_at": "2021-08-13T01:49:32Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f333a2ce258224e54c4f898b720df7b8ee70fdfc", "message": "Revert \"Revert \"Basic Burger Menu Navigation with Fragments\"\"\n\nThis reverts commit 1e29b37f8031e1abf025a22acb3abd3ce0686356.", "created_at": "2021-08-06T06:30:56Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1e29b37f8031e1abf025a22acb3abd3ce0686356", "message": "Revert \"Basic Burger Menu Navigation with Fragments\"\n\nThis reverts commit 8f44d4e26b38dc98fa91c35f7062e4fda4691940.", "created_at": "2021-08-06T06:26:10Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8f44d4e26b38dc98fa91c35f7062e4fda4691940", "message": "Basic Burger Menu Navigation with Fragments", "created_at": "2021-08-06T05:52:26Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e162f3daf1f37c9840098486e5ab2e83cd76107", "message": "Basic Burger Menu Navigation with Fragments", "created_at": "2021-08-06T05:50:26Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "16cb98bd80e98d07bece238e5921879376c6f191", "message": "Completed Todo-List & New Color Scheme", "created_at": "2021-08-06T01:19:33Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "de56f2d6f3974a2f8e42c4a100ac8b73ae103b55", "message": "Initial Commit\n\nBase app with todo list using SQLite database", "created_at": "2021-08-05T11:07:27Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "157ebaec5bce8d6a24f97791addb763e7f977acf", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2021-08-05T11:06:22Z", "repo": "Android-Teacher-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dfede9e214fc9417ff6ec4965d09eca22858052f", "message": "Add Python Design Patterns", "created_at": "2022-04-07T00:38:20Z", "repo": "Resources", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "962a311931eb989998f5c2732e2044219e302222", "message": "Merge branch 'master' of https://github.com/Broderick-Westrope/Resources", "created_at": "2022-04-06T20:49:59Z", "repo": "Resources", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c25fc231f2f8c5c8016866f36a22f93f5537d0df", "message": "Improve Organisation", "created_at": "2022-04-06T20:49:53Z", "repo": "Resources", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2555c863a472aed592d09098b6c85f7a0fc68e2e", "message": "Create README.md", "created_at": "2022-02-11T00:12:44Z", "repo": "Resources", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9ad45e868c3d8cb513aef08a1f408d7125bffcf2", "message": "Initial Commit", "created_at": "2022-02-10T21:46:22Z", "repo": "Resources", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}